  "id": "psychometric-examination",
  "term": "psychometric examination",
  "definition": "A psychometric examination is a preliminary evaluation of a measurement tool to see how well it functions as a questionnaire or scale. It looks at features such as its factor structure, the consistency of its subscales, and whether its scores relate to other relevant constructs in expected ways.",
